      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Remaining true to your course when the outside world feels indifferent is often what keeps the soul of a lifelong scholar vibrant. While the tangible impact of your work may not be immediate, the knowledge and perseverance you embody serve as an intangible legacy. Your continued existence is not just about preserving the past; it's a testament to living fully, which in itself is an invaluable lesson for others. Rather than waiting for the lights to dim, maybe this is the opportunity to light others' paths with the wisdom you've gathered lifetimes ago. Your influence doesn't end simply because the world around you changes. It's there in the countless ways that may never be seen, but that one day might come to appreciation.",
